#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access（Tunnel + 应用 Token）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> 通过 **Cloudflare Tunnel** 将家里 PC 上的 Hub 暴露到公网时，由 Hub **`remote_auth`** Bearer Token 保护非本地连接。\n"
"> 安全上下文：[`security.md`](security.md) · 安装：[`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "概览"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 层                    | 作用                                                                                  |\n"
"| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Hub `remote_auth`** | `config.yaml` 明文 token；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect` 帧 `auth_token` |\n"
"| **cloudflared**       | 出站隧道，把公网 HTTPS/WSS 转到 `127.0.0.1:2658`                                      |\n"
"| **客户端设置**        | app/desktop / app/mobile 在 **Hub 设置页**填写同一 Hub 地址与 token                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:19
msgid ""
"仅当 **Host 为 loopback**（`127.0.0.1` / `localhost` / `::1`）**且 TCP 对端也"
"为 loopback** 时 **不验 token**（本地开发、CLI/systemd 探活）。公网域名（经 "
"Tunnel）、局域网 IP 等访问时须带 token；与 `tunnel.enabled` 无关。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:21
msgid ""
"可选：仍可在 Cloudflare 配置 Access（浏览器 IdP 登录）；bundled 客户端走应用 "
"Token，不依赖 Access。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Hub 配置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:25
msgid ""
"在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中设置（**仅本地使用可省略**；暴露到局域网或公网前"
"必须配置）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remote_auth:\n"
"  token: \"请替换为 openssl rand -base64 32 生成的随机串\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:32
msgid "生成示例："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "openssl rand -base64 32\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:38
msgid ""
"`.gitignore` 已忽略 `config.yaml`；请勿提交到 git。Admin API 读配置时会对 "
"`remote_auth.token` 脱敏显示。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Tunnel（可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima tunnel setup   # 可跳过 Access API 步骤\n"
"anima service start\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:47
msgid ""
"`tunnel.enabled: true` 时随服务启动 cloudflared。Ingress 指向本机 Hub 端口"
"（默认 `2658`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "若不使用 Tunnel，仅在局域网用 `http://<PC-IP>:2658` 亦可；客户端同样需在设置页填写 token。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloudflare 凭证（pass）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| pass 路径                                | 用途                     |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/api-token`          | 创建 Tunnel / DNS        |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/tunnel-credentials` | `cloudflared` 连接器凭证 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:58
msgid "详见向导 `anima tunnel setup`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. 客户端配置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "**app/desktop** 与 **app/mobile** 均视为远端客户端，**不读取** Hub 的 `config.yaml`。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 客户端      | 存储位置                     |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------------- |\n"
"| app/desktop | `~/.anima/shell-client.json` |\n"
"| app/mobile  | Capacitor Preferences        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:69
msgid "设置项（两端一致）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:72
msgid ""
"**Hub 地址** — 如 `https://anima.example.com` 或 `http://192.168.1.10:2658`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:72
msgid "**远程 Token** — 与 Hub `remote_auth.token` 相同"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:74
msgid ""
"操作：打开 Hub 设置 → 填写 → **测试连接** → 保存。桌面端保存后需 **重启 app/"
"desktop**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. 认证行为"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
"SAP:   WebSocket /sap/v1 → connect 帧含 auth_token 字段\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:83
msgid "缺少或错误 token → HTTP `401` 或 SAP 连接关闭。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:85
msgid ""
"判定依据为请求 URL 的 **Host**（经 Tunnel 时为公网域名，如 "
"`anima.example.com`）与 **TCP 对端地址**；Hub 不读取 `tunnel.enabled` 决定是"
"否验 token。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "运维命令"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 命令                          | 说明                      |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima tunnel status`         | Tunnel / cloudflared 状态 |\n"
"| `anima tunnel start` / `stop` | 侧车启停                  |\n"
"| `anima service status`        | Hub 是否运行              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "故障排查"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 现象                   | 检查                                                       |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 公网 502               | Hub 是否运行？`anima service status`                       |\n"
"| 公网 1033              | `anima tunnel status` 中 `connected: no`                   |\n"
"| 401                    | 客户端 token 是否与 `remote_auth.token` 一致               |\n"
"| 本机开发正常、远程失败 | 远程请求是否带 Bearer / SAP auth_token；公网 Host 须 token |\n"
"| 改 token 后仍 401      | 更新 Hub config **并** 各客户端设置页                      |\n"
msgstr ""

